        "id": 1444467
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-22T02:06:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The current scenario I have tested is run `ectool chargecontrol idle` without the extra control and run those specific routine manually. Yeah, I can also test by putting the extra control here. If it works fine, then I think `is_chg_ctrl_mode_idle_disabled` can be removed.",
      "parentUuid": "eb63a0aa_ede9651f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1455,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 1455,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "f35873a4cb88a1d03af5965d4b5b1876525e94d8",
